OL,3,GNEWSAScheme aids lions in the wild and
OL,4,AKenyan villagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent-based charity is funding a
OL,7,F"pioneering" scheme helping villagers
OL,8,Fin Kenya and discouraging them from
OL,9,Fkilling lions in the wild.
OL,11,FChris MacSween runs Lion Aid from her
OL,12,Fhome in Dover. The project was devised
OL,13,Ftogether with the Maasai communities,
OL,14,Fwho administer it themselves.
OL,16,FThe charity's Merrueshi Project helps
OL,17,Fvillagers to protect their livestock,
OL,18,Fdiscouraging them from retaliatory
OL,19,Fkillings of wild animals.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
