OL,3,GNEWSAScheme aids lions in the wild and
OL,4,AKenyan villagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacSween described the scheme as "the
OL,7,Fbiggest joy of my life, allowing rural
OL,8,Fcommunities and wildlife to coexist
OL,9,Fharmoniously".
